Fires out a bolt of cosmic energy in the target direction. The projectile continues until it hits a wall or the edge of the map, dealing [153, 205, 246, 281, 312 (TL1-5; SP 100)] dark damage to enemies hit and restoring [6, 8, 9, 10, 12 (TL1-5)] negative energy. The negative energy gained is reduced by 25% per enemy hit, restoring a maximum of [24, 32, 36, 40, 48 (TL1-5)]. Enemies hit will become aware of you.
